OL,3,GNEWSANearly all police feel pay is too
OL,4,Alow - survey
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly all Thames Valley Police (TVP)
OL,7,Fofficers who responded to a national
OL,8,Fsurvey said they did not feel fairly
OL,9,Fpaid for the stresses they incur in
OL,10,Ftheir job.
OL,12,FThe TVP Federation, which represents
OL,13,Frank-and-file officers, said 93% of
OL,14,Fabout 660 respondents answered that way
OL,15,Fin a survey led by the Police
OL,16,FFederation of England and Wales.
OL,18,FAileen O'Connor, who chairs the TVP
OL,19,FFederation, said the "most concerning"
OL,20,Ffinding from that was that 27% of
OL,21,Fofficers said they intend to resign
OL,22,Ffrom the force within two years.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
