OL,3,GNEWSANearly all police feel pay is too
OL,4,Alow - survey
OL,5,
OL,6,FTVP's deputy chief constable Ben Snuggs
OL,7,Fsaid the force takes the findings
OL,8,F"seriously and remains committed to
OL,9,Fsupporting our officers and staff".
